.TH DANBY-CANNIBALISM 1
.SH NAME
danby-cannibalism \- age-structured population with adult cannibalism
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/cannibalism
.SH MODEL
J' = bA-mJ-dJ J-cJA;
A' = mJ+ecJA-dA A.
.PP
J and A are young and adult animals.  Cannibalism removes young while a
fraction e of consumed biomass contributes to adults.  Keeping the stages
separate exposes when cannibalism is a loss, a density regulator, or a transfer
between age classes.
.SH CONTROLS
Drag either state bar.  The six tracks set birth, maturation, cannibalism,
food conversion, and young and adult death.  Space pauses, period steps,
r resets, and q exits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/cannibalism.b
.br
.B /appl/danby/cannibalism.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR populationmodel (2),
.IR danby-childcare (1)
